 The meter can store 200,000 pieces of data, has a recording capability and backlight option. The meter acts like an external drive when connected to the computer, so allowing data export. The stored information on the portable data logger can be exported to your computer.',NULL,'active','approved',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-11 15:27:28','2026-10-11 15:27:28'),(387,3,'MISCIMPORT Core BosMedical Grade Adhesive Patches: 24-box','miscimport-core-bosmedical-grade-adhesive-patches-24-box-00212088','Our specially designed medical-grade patches are convenient way to wear your CORE. These custom patches are produced specifically for CORE by our industrial medical supplier using high grade, medically certified materials. The patches are designed to minimise skin irritation while delivering good adhesion. The foam contours with your body for a seamless fit even for extended periods of time. Often when wearing CORE with a patch - you forget you have it on. Each box contains 24 adhesive patches. The medical patches are suited to every-day use and can be used while sleeping. These are not waterproof and can be temporarily detached (patch and core) for showers, bathing. IMPORTANT: These patches are not suitable for sports use',NULL,'active','approved',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-11 15:27:28','2026-10-11 15:27:28'),(388,3,'MISCIMPORT Core Chest Strap-ONLY','miscimport-core-chest-strap-only-00212097','For the most accurate core body temperature measurements, CORE is worn on the chest. The chest strap is a convenient and reusable solution for wearing the CORE discretely for extended duration and particularly for sporting activities. The chest strap is made of soft stretchable nylon that can be easily washed and reused. The adjustable strap accommodates a wide range of sizes and is one-size-fits-all. This chest strap is an alternative to the medical-grade patches and when using the black fastening clips (which are provided with the CORE), is a reliable method to secure CORE for active and s